OL,3,GNEWSABid to split county into two
OL,4,Asupercouncils dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to split Staffordshire into two
OL,7,F'supercouncils' have been withdrawn by
OL,8,Fthe government but reorganisation will
OL,9,Fstill go ahead, it has been confirmed.
OL,11,FMinisters said on Thursday that the
OL,12,Fplan for the new council boundaries
OL,13,Fwould be announced in early 2027.
OL,15,FIt was announced in July that
OL,16,FStaffordshire's ten councils were due
OL,17,Fto be scrapped and replaced with new
OL,18,Fnorthern and southern unitary
OL,19,Fauthorities, but plans were put on hold
OL,20,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
