OL,3,GNEWSABid to split county into two
OL,4,Asupercouncils dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Fsaid he would look at the options for
OL,8,Feach area with an "open mind" and would
OL,9,Fnot be drawn on whether the
OL,10,Fcontroversial north-south split would
OL,11,Fbe adopted.
